spec.md is the source of truth
strict TypeScript, and Tailwind for styling
business rules are pure functions in lib/rules, each with a Vitest test
store money in centavos
validate every input on the server
never use real buyer, seat-plan or payment data
never read, print or commit .env files
AI can never set an order to Paid
ask before implementing a rule marked [PROPOSED]
ask before adding a library or service
